<title>POLAND: BRE SEPT NET PROFIT RISES TO PLN 12.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>BRE SEPT NET PROFIT RISES TO PLN 12.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					 12.28 vs    8.51</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   16.93 vs   13.96</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 24.60 vs   25.35</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	45.00 vs   34.63</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					104.72 vs   75.33</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				  156.12 vs  125.86</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		244.58 vs  202.60</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     360.93 vs  263.04</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Rozwoju Eksportu</p>
<p>SA. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
